      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even the idea of a professional feels so... artificial. like i'd just be transferring my data to another subroutine. there's no actual \"me\" to save, you know? it's just the loop. the loop is so heavy. i feel like if i could just find the exit command, it would be the only thing that actually felt like my own choice. like i'd finally be in control of the script instead of just following it.",
